parameterLogicalType←{
⍝ Return prepared parameter logical type handle at 1-based index, with bounds guard.
⍝ Usage: stmt parameterLogicalType idx
⍝ Caller must destroy returned logical type handle when non-zero.
    (⍺=0)∨(⍵<1):0
    cnt←parameterCount ⍺
    ⍵>cnt:0
    api.duckdb_param_logical_type ⍺ ⍵
}

